Subject: [PATCH] [PR #60068] [MRV2][Spec Decode] Opt-in confidence stop for
 autoregressive drafting

Net diff of #60068, rebased to apply after main, #59958, #59973 and patch 01 (#59740 + #60226). Changes versus the PR branch: upstream main renamed spec_decode/autoregressive to spec_decode/target_dependent_ar (#60335), so the speculator change and its unit test now target vllm/v1/worker/gpu/spec_decode/target_dependent_ar/speculator.py and tests/v1/worker/test_gpu_target_dependent_ar_speculator.py. In tests/v1/e2e/spec_decode/mtp/qwen3_5/test_mtp.py and docs/features/speculative_decoding/mtp.md the additions from #59973 and #60068 are both kept.

Upstream-PR: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60068

